    "t5": { "x": 0, "y": 5440, "text": "Behind the scenes · streams and testing", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2280 },
    "q1": { "x": 1360, "y": 0, "w": 380, "fill": "orange", "text": "Naming to agree:\n• Monitor → Stream (what you watch)\n• Source → the kind (GitHub, Octopus…)\n• Subscriber → Listener\n• Test bench → Simulator\n\nDoes this read right to you?" },
    "q2": { "x": 1640, "y": 2400, "w": 360, "fill": "blue", "text": "Activity is the home tab: the same list the widget shows, with room for detail. The widget becomes a mini Activity, not the only way in." },
    "q3": { "x": 1180, "y": 3500, "w": 380, "fill": "blue", "text": "The answer to \"why\" is per pull request, in plain words, with a fix button. Poll traces move to Diagnostics on a stream, for when you really need them." },
    "q4": { "x": 1820, "y": 4600, "w": 360, "fill": "orange", "text": "Same pattern as Postern: an app asks, you approve once, you can revoke. Should approval be needed for read-only hints at all?" },
    "q5": { "x": 2360, "y": 5700, "w": 380, "fill": "orange", "text": "Move the test bench into Pylon as a Simulator (dev builds only)? One app instead of two, and simulated repos behave like any other stream." }
  },
